ation is completely fraudulent  and therefore should be shut down  because that's Trump's ultimate goal is  to shut it down or at the very least by  robert muller which is actually gonna  create a lot more headache for him than  muller already has it's a lose-lose  situation for this guy but he doesn't  understand that yet he thinks that he  can fire robert muller paint him as this  corrupt democratic plant and somehow  that's gonna end the investigation big  smiles all around for the trump  administration a happy ending he goes on  to serve 30 more years as president but  really this is gonna backfire  just like everything this man has done  since becoming president everything he  touches turns to garbage every plan he  has falls apart and everything he does  actually ends up giving more fodder to  the special prosecutor they get the  núñez memo right that was supposed to  clear the air and show us how corrupt  these departments are it actually did  the opposite and told us that the FISA  warrant and the investigation itself  were not based on the steel dossier  that's what it said in the Nunez memo it  was not based on the steel dossier yet  to this day we have the president out  there still saying it's all based on the  dirty dossier well let me ask you this  folks let's assume that it was all based  on the dossier that was originally  funded by the Washington free beacon  conservatives then picked up by Hillary  Clinton then actually self-financed  after the Hillary Clinton's law firm  that was representing her stopped paying  so they say Democrats funded it but it's  literally across the board you have  conservatives you have Democrats and you  have self-financing after everybody else  stop paying because they believed it was  worth looking into nonetheless suppose  it was all based on the dossier all  right let's think about that  what from the dossiers been proven false  can anyone you know maybe tweeted at me  what parts of the dossier have been  proven to b